{"synopsis":"\\[Dari studio yang mengerjakan \\<The Novel’s Extra (Remake)>!]\n\nLee Saehoon, blacksmith dari pasukan terakhir umat manusia yang penuh keputusasaan, bertarung melawan para iblis hingga detik terakhir.&#x20;\n\nNamun, hasilnya adalah kehancuran bersama, dan dunia pun berakhir. Pada saat ia mengakhiri hidupnya karena kesimpulan yang sia-sia itu...\n\n“…Apa ini?”\n\nIa telah kembali ke masa ketika dirinya masih menjadi kandidat di institusi pelatihan pahlawan, Akademi Babel. Setelah memperoleh kesempatan kedua, dia bersumpah akan menggunakan apa pun sebagai alat untuk meraih kemenangan kali ini. Apa pun!","alternative_title":"회귀자가 다 만들어줌","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"24375505-c6ec-4da9-90b1-20c17a737ebe","date":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"a157ac36-9790-4769-afea-2f7d8e40ce6a","date":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"fadf94d8-ad78-438b-b9f8-c991d60ee226","date":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"43c39019-71de-4406-bb26-f3e0eb5e5a86","date":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"936317e0-ecee-495f-ae8c-be86b918d0ba","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"fd19f0cb-ab14-4aa7-ac07-0560cfb869a6","date":"2026-06-06","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"082f0c9a-5ab1-4570-b455-2b7fe1a6eb77","date":"2026-05-30","images":[]},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"1db9ee97-ffd3-4db9-a24b-c328f47b00fc","date":"2026-05-16","images":[]},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"c86cb09d-c18e-4cd8-a236-7ccea4ab1cd1","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"88dcfd5d-800c-4ed0-8538-1ae4cd868114","date":"2026-04-25","images":[]},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"ca5c4cca-2436-4d60-9b4e-b45261c3febb","date":"2026-04-11","images":[]},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"9bfab679-2b10-40ec-a856-12a83e5674b6","date":"2026-